# RStudio / R session state
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata

# renv (commit renv.lock itself, not the library)
renv/library/
renv/staging/
renv/python/

# Raw KoBo pulls and any local data exchange - sensitive/reproducible, not
# for version control (mirrors 1_sampling/'s input_data/ convention)
input_data/
data/

# cleaning/ and reports/ - real submission data, partner-submitted files,
# and generated outputs are kept out of version control entirely (never
# pushed anywhere from here). field_verify/ (inter-partner boundary-dispute
# correspondence) likewise.
#
# FIX 2026-09-11: these two used to be blanket-ignored as whole directories.
# That silently meant every hand-written pipeline SCRIPT living inside them
# (issue_tracker.R, apply_review_decisions.R, prep_real_submissions.R,
# independent_deletion_checks.R, the whole recovery-workbook build, etc.)
# had zero git history and zero backup - found only after a full day
# building/fixing that logic with nothing to show for it in git. Script code
# (.R/.py/.md) is tracked from here on; real data, partner files, generated
# outputs, and tracker/log snapshots stay excluded below by name/extension.
# cleaning/MSNA_Data_Cleaning/ is a separate legacy pipeline (data officer's
# own, read-only from here per CLAUDE.md) - left fully excluded for now,
# not evaluated for the same fix yet.
field_verify/
cleaning/MSNA_Data_Cleaning/
cleaning/*.rds
cleaning/_archive/
cleaning/real/*.csv
cleaning/real/handoff_for_resampling/
reports/partner_digests/
# 2026-09-28 pre-push audit: cleaning/UNHCR_MSNA_Data_Cleaning/ is the same
# kind of data officer's own, read-only pipeline as cleaning/MSNA_Data_Cleaning/
# above, carries real raw survey data + a confirmed respondent PII string in
# resources/pii_redactions.csv - excluded the same way, not evaluated further.
# The two partner_status_emails_2026-09-21* folders are real, partner-facing
# HTML content (per-LGA/pop-type tables addressed to each partner) - out of
# git per standing convention, same as every other partner-communications
# draft in this project.
cleaning/UNHCR_MSNA_Data_Cleaning/
# 2026-10-03: the data officer's combined MSNA + UNHCR cleaning project (raw_data/, output/, audit/, zips) - the
# same kind of read-only pipeline as the two above, excluded the same way.
cleaning/NGA2605_MSNA_UNHCR_Combined_Cleaning/
reports/partner_status_emails_2026-09-21/
reports/partner_status_emails_2026-09-21_corrected/
# config/ itself IS tracked (coverage_decisions.csv, partner_registry.csv are
# real config, not data dumps) - but config/_archive/ holds pre-change backup
# snapshots of those files, same convention as data/_archive/ (excluded via
# the blanket data/ rule above) - a snapshot's history is already in git once
# the file it copies is tracked, so it doesn't need its own copy versioned too.
config/_archive/
reports/partner_data_recovery/inputs/
reports/partner_data_recovery/outputs/
reports/accessibility_review/
reports/lga_prioritization/
# 2026-10-02: Round 1 weighting package for the data officer - holds the
# anonymised dataset with weights attached, so it is never versioned.
reports/round1_weighting_package*/
# 2026-10-04: the Round 1 IPC/CH representativity deliverables (xlsx + intermediate CSVs) - outputs, not code; the
# builder lives in 1_sampling.
reports/round1_ipc_ch_representativity_*/
# FIX 2026-09-11 (later same night): the two backup dirs previously excluded
# here by their old top-level names were archived into
# reports/partner_data_recovery/_archive/<date>_<reason>/ as part of the
# same night's cleanup pass - excluding the new parent instead so this
# doesn't silently start tracking them again. Only ever holds data-backup
# snapshots, unlike scripts/_archive/ below (mixed - see that line).
reports/partner_data_recovery/_archive/
reports/partner_data_recovery/scripts/_test_fixtures/
reports/partner_data_recovery/scripts/_archive/2026-09-06_pre_tracker_migration_backups/
reports/partner_data_recovery/scripts/*.csv

# Shiny deployment metadata (machine/account-specific)
dashboard_app/rsconnect/

# Assist tool local settings (machine/user-specific)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# OS
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Python
__pycache__/
# 2026-10-04: run_refresh_and_deploy.R's per-run reports and logs (local to each computer; logs can name interviews)
runs_log/
